### Rollback Protection

ESP-IDF supports **automatic rollback** — critical for production:

```c
// After OTA boot, validate the firmware works correctly
// (e.g., can reach the server, sensors read OK, etc.)
esp_ota_mark_app_valid_cancel_rollback();

